"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-8e5d7a62-8e2f-46d5-a03e-474d89ad0bac","sdu-ff718da3-7365-4a29-ac6c-78a22520e6f5"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"The Healthy Start project : a randomized, controlled intervention to prevent overweight among normal weight, preschool children at high risk of future overweight","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-096.40-044312","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
